{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04491","headline":"入峭峡安居谿伐木谿源幽邃林岭相映有奇致焉 · 陈子昂","name":"入峭峡安居谿伐木谿源幽邃林岭相映有奇致焉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃徒歌伐木，骛檝漾轻舟。\n靡迤随廻水，潺湲泝浅流。\n烟沙分两岸，露岛夹双洲。\n古树连云密，交峰入浪浮。\n岩潭相映媚，谿谷屡环周。\n路迥光逾逼，山深兴转幽。\n麕鼯寒思晚，猿鸟暮声秋。\n誓息兰台策，将从桂树游。\n因书谢亲爱，千岁觅蓬丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}